{"title":"Werewolf Pelt","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Monster drop: Werewolf, Alpha Werewolf, Lycan, Werewolf, Alpha Werewolf +1 more</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <div style=\"margin-top:10px\"><b>Recorded monster drops</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"werewolf\" title=\"Werewolf - Normal, 35.5% of recorded drops (3,119 / 8,782 events)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/0ebf199ce603121d6b69.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Werewolf</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">35.5%</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"alpha-werewolf\" title=\"Alpha Werewolf - Normal, 32.3% of recorded drops (290 / 897 events)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/fc7711ec9ecca6b88e5c.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Alpha Werewolf</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">32.3%</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"lycan\" title=\"Lycan - Normal, 26.8% of recorded drops (101 / 377 events)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/0d3c73d7e69d29ade0e0.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Lycan</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">26.8%</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink elite\" data-monster=\"werewolf\" title=\"Werewolf - Elite, 58.3% of recorded drops (56 / 96 events)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/0ebf199ce603121d6b69.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Werewolf</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">58.3%</span></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip-row-more-btn\" data-label=\"+2 more\">+2 more</button><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra monsterlink elite\" data-monster=\"alpha-werewolf\" title=\"Alpha Werewolf - Elite, 57.1% of recorded drops (8 / 14 events)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/fc7